OL,3,GNEWSACambridge outing for fire brigade
OL,4,Amusical songs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSongs from a musical which celebrates a
OL,7,F19th Century physics student will be
OL,8,Fheard in the city where she studied for
OL,9,Fthe first time.
OL,11,FThe musical tells the story of how
OL,12,FHertha Ayrton founded an all-women fire
OL,13,Fbrigade in 1879 at Girton College, then
OL,14,Fa women's college at Cambridge
OL,15,FUniversity.
OL,17,FMusic from The Cambridge First
OL,18,FAll-Ladies Fire Brigade musical will be
OL,19,Fheard at an Open Cambridge event at the
OL,20,Funiversity's Whipple Museum in
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
